                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. свойство по значению прилагательного самодостаточный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7217102c-1bb1-417c-9f2a-74b055d37ff3",
                                "sense_id": "a90b2d01-e3b0-35a5-aa61-9006acd70736",
                                "text": "При решении этих проблем она встала на путь гиноцентризма, доказывая абсолютную универсальность и самодостаточность женщин."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "417d5b7a-bdf3-4cac-bc9f-bde2d37ad64a",
                        "source_entry_id": "73dcb94d-8830-3813-91cc-e5a231b1fc0b",
                        "source_sense_id": "a90b2d01-e3b0-35a5-aa61-9006acd70736",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-sufficiency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-sufficiency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5f638c7-fcdd-368a-bbf9-06a6ac33d59f",
                                        "entry_id": "c7860309-adbd-3f8d-88d2-a0c3965c2eda",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being self-sufficient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c20a9af5-8c26-421f-880c-794ca791d73d",
                                                "sense_id": "d5f638c7-fcdd-368a-bbf9-06a6ac33d59f",
                                                "text": "“For my own part,” she rejoined, “I must confess that I never could see any beauty in her. Her face is too thin; her complexion has no brilliancy; and her features are not at all handsome. Her nose wants character; there is nothing marked in its lines. Her teeth are tolerable, but not out of the common way; and as for her eyes, which have sometimes been called so fine, I never could perceive any thing extraordinary. They have a sharp, shrewish look, which I do not like at all; and in her air altogether, there is a self-sufficiency without fashion, which is intolerable.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
